      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "「首狩り岩」というのを知ってるか？\n近くを通った兵士が、蠢く大きな影を見たらしい。\n少し遠いが、噂の正体を確かめたい……\n何かの見間違いだと思うんだが、俺も気になってね。",
        "official_en": "Ever heard of Headsman's Rock? Soldiers passing\nthrough say there's an enormous shadow guarding\nthe place! It's way too far away for me to see for\nmyself, but I wonder if the rumor's true.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
